---
// About section component
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Left side with content -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">
          About the Cooperative AI South Africa Fellowship
        </h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700">
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
            The Cooperative AI South Africa Fellowship is a 3 months-long fellowship designed for participants from diverse backgrounds around the world to pursue AI Safety from a cooperative AI perspective research. The fellowship will run from January - April 2026 and kicks off with a week-long retreat and culminates with a possible conference.
          </p>
          
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Fellows will work with collaborators from partner organisations such as the Cooperative AI Foundation (CAIF), Principles of Intelligent Behavior in Biological and Social Systems (PIBBSS) and The University of Cape Town (UCT) AI Initiative.
          </p>
          
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Participants will receive mentorship from top researchers in the field of cooperative AI, resources for building knowledge in AI safety and comprehensive financial support covering their living and travel expenses while in Cape Town.
          </p>
          
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
            There will be opportunities for collaboration with other cohort members, a week-long retreat, workshops and access to the AI Safety Cape Town co-working space.
          </p>
          
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Alumni from previous iterations of similar fellowships have gone on to work in academia, leading AI Safety labs, UK AISI, or started independent research among others.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Right side with background -->
      <div class="bg-yellow-50 h-96 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-orange-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium">Research & Innovation</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Apply button centered at bottom -->
    <div class="text-center mt-12">
      <a href="#apply" class="inline-block bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-md text-lg font-semibold transition-colors duration-200">
        APPLY NOW
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
